!.env.example

# Never commit credentials or user captures.
**/secrets/*
!**/secrets/README.md
**/logs/*
**/debug/*
**/reports/*
*.pcap
*.pcapng

# Generated or externally supplied runtime resources.
endfield-logs/data/*
!endfield-logs/data/README.md
endfield-pcap/data/*
!endfield-pcap/data/README.md
endfield-pcap/jsondata/*
!endfield-pcap/jsondata/README.md
endfield-pcap/proto/*
!endfield-pcap/proto/README.md
endfield-logs/apps/web/public/images/*
!endfield-logs/apps/web/public/images/README.md
endfield-logs/apps/web/public/endaxis/*
!endfield-logs/apps/web/public/endaxis/README.md

# Local test/build metadata and captured evidence are never source exports.
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.egg-info/
**/docs/evidence/
**/tests/fixtures/*.log
**/tests/fixtures/*.jsonl
**/*-components.json
**/component-*.zip
**/build_meta/
